<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>CSG-21 in the Eastern Mediterranean, 2021</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;CSG-21 approaches the Syrian coast, where its aircraft are expected to engage in the first combat sorties from a UK aircraft carrier in a generation.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Tensions with Russia have been rising again due to the CSG-21 deployment in general, and&amp;nbsp;in particular&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;incidents this past week with &lt;EM&gt;HMS Defender&lt;/EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;and &lt;EM&gt;HNLMS Evertsen&lt;/EM&gt; during&amp;nbsp;their freedom of&amp;nbsp;navigation operations&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the Black Sea. As a result of the harrassment and the buildup of Russian units in the Eastern Mediterranean while the strike group refueled at Souda Naval Base, the Ministry of Defense&amp;nbsp;has decided to concentrate its forces. All the surface vessels of the strike group are to rendezvous&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;the air wing&amp;nbsp;commences operations against ISIS.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
